   "lines": [
    {
     "n": 1,
     "text": "Don’t resort to lowly things,"
    },
    {
     "n": 2,
     "text": "don’t abide in negligence,"
    },
    {
     "n": 3,
     "text": "don’t resort to wrong views,"
    },
    {
     "n": 4,
     "text": "don’t perpetuate the world."
    },
    {
     "n": 5,
     "text": "Get up, don’t be heedless,"
    },
    {
     "n": 6,
     "text": "live by principle, with good conduct."
    },
    {
     "n": 7,
     "text": "For one of good conduct sleeps at ease,"
    },
    {
     "n": 8,
     "text": "in this world and the next."
    },
    {
     "n": 9,
     "text": "Live by principle, with good conduct,"
    },
    {
     "n": 10,
     "text": "don’t conduct yourself badly."
    },
    {
     "n": 11,
     "text": "For one of good conduct sleeps at ease,"
    },
    {
     "n": 12,
     "text": "in this world and the next."
    },
    {
     "n": 13,
     "text": "Look upon the world"
    },
    {
     "n": 14,
     "text": "as a bubble"
    },
    {
     "n": 15,
     "text": "or a mirage,"
    },
    {
     "n": 16,
     "text": "then the King of Death won’t see you."
    },
    {
     "n": 17,
     "text": "Come, see this world decked out"
    },
    {
     "n": 18,
     "text": "like a fancy royal chariot."
    },
    {
     "n": 19,
     "text": "Here fools founder,"
    },
    {
     "n": 20,
     "text": "but the discerning are not chained."
    },
    {
     "n": 21,
     "text": "He who once was heedless,"
    },
    {
     "n": 22,
     "text": "but turned to heedfulness,"
    },
    {
     "n": 23,
     "text": "shines upon this world"
    },
    {
     "n": 24,
     "text": "like the moon freed from clouds."
    },
    {
     "n": 25,
     "text": "Someone whose bad deed"
    },
    {
     "n": 26,
     "text": "is supplanted by the good,"
    },
    {
     "n": 27,
     "text": "shines upon this world,"
    },
    {
     "n": 28,
     "text": "like the moon freed from clouds."
    },
    {
     "n": 29,
     "text": "Blind is the world,"
    },
    {
     "n": 30,
     "text": "few are those who clearly see."
    },
    {
     "n": 31,
     "text": "Only a handful go to heaven,"
    },
    {
     "n": 32,
     "text": "like a bird freed from a net."
    },
    {
     "n": 33,
     "text": "Swans fly by the sun’s path,"
    },
    {
     "n": 34,
     "text": "psychic sages fly through space."
    },
    {
     "n": 35,
     "text": "The attentive leave the world,"
    },
    {
     "n": 36,
     "text": "having vanquished Māra with his legions."
    },
    {
     "n": 37,
     "text": "When a personage, spurning the hereafter,"
    },
    {
     "n": 38,
     "text": "transgresses in just one thing—"
    },
    {
     "n": 39,
     "text": "lying—"
    },
    {
     "n": 40,
     "text": "there is no evil they would not do."
    },
    {
     "n": 41,
     "text": "The miserly don’t ascend to heaven,"
    },
    {
     "n": 42,
     "text": "it takes a fool to not praise giving."
    },
    {
     "n": 43,
     "text": "The attentive celebrate giving,"
    },
    {
     "n": 44,
     "text": "and so find happiness in the hereafter."
    },
    {
     "n": 45,
     "text": "The fruit of stream-entry is better"
    },
    {
     "n": 46,
     "text": "than being the one king of the earth,"
    },
    {
     "n": 47,
     "text": "than going to heaven,"
    },
    {
     "n": 48,
     "text": "than lordship over all the world."
    }
   ]
  }
 ]
